        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">per <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5087365489\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45041\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45041/hovercard?comment_id=4202151823&amp;comment_type=review_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45041#discussion_r4202151823\">#45041 (comment)</a>, we can leave out the status key and the SeeCompatTable macro as they get added when by BCD (<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/MDN/Writing_guidelines/Page_structures/Page_types/CSS_property_page_template#status\" rel=\"nofollow\">template</a>)</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR removes the status of experimental and the macro from all css properties with both.</p>",
