        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18056682?u=4303632dec0ef4b92e430c5b30839265b30d1aab&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Hello, Just wanted to start a placeholder here for the upcoming controls attribute future.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Clarified the 'controls' attribute implementation status and provided additional context on its usage in browsers.</p>\n\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There is now a partial implementation of the controls attribute in browsers. Specifically its in Webkit Safari now.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It is a new attribute relevant to developers and users that is now partially implemented and being considered by other browsers</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4237813633\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43730\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43730/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43730\">#43730</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Partially implements:<br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4237813633\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43730\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43730/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43730\">#43730</a></p>",
