        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add the shared list of destination slugs Rari can use to suppress broken-link flaws across locales.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Suppress known intentional broken-link flaws to reduce noise in Rari reports. This is a step towards <code class=\"notranslate\">mdn/fred#1105</code>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The unique slugs are grouped by best-effort rationale. Three report targets with existing en-US pages are omitted. The file comments describe its cross-locale scope and that <code class=\"notranslate\">fix-flaws</code> should prune stale entries.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3670953394\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/issues/1105\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/fred/issues/1105/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/issues/1105\">mdn/fred#1105</a>.</p>",
