        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Compress the 15 images that the sharp-based filecheck reports as compressible, using <code class=\"notranslate\">npm run filecheck -- --save-compression</code>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ensure that PRs touching these images do not fail filecheck after the compressor switch.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>File</th>\n<th>Before</th>\n<th>After</th>\n<th>Savings</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">glossary/bezier_curve/bezier_2_big.gif</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/c82ef871532e8cf9bf8972f8c076d57cd95bb8b2/files/en-us/glossary/bezier_curve/bezier_2_big.gif\">150.3 KB</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/95ac0ebd0953f2846f5446c52207e4e9831dad3b/files/en-us/glossary/bezier_curve/bezier_2_big.gif\">109.1 KB</a></td>\n<td>27%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">web/css/reference/properties/image-orientation/oriole.jpg</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/c82ef871532e8cf9bf8972f8c076d57cd95bb8b2/files/en-us/web/css/reference/properties/image-orientation/oriole.jpg\">88.2 KB</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/95ac0ebd0953f2846f5446c52207e4e9831dad3b/files/en-us/web/css/reference/properties/image-orientation/oriole.jpg\">52.8 KB</a></td>\n<td>40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">learn_web_development/core/structuring_content/headings_and_paragraphs/newspaper_small.jpg</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/c82ef871532e8cf9bf8972f8c076d57cd95bb8b2/files/en-us/learn_web_development/core/structuring_content/headings_and_paragraphs/newspaper_smal