m/mdn/content/blob/c82ef871532e8cf9bf8972f8c076d57cd95bb8b2/files/en-us/web/css/reference/at-rules/@font-face/font-style/garamondartificialstyle.jpg\">8.6 KB</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/95ac0ebd0953f2846f5446c52207e4e9831dad3b/files/en-us/web/css/reference/at-rules/@font-face/font-style/garamondartificialstyle.jpg\">3.0 KB</a></td>\n<td>65%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">web/api/htmlelement/offsetleft/offsetleft.jpg</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/c82ef871532e8cf9bf8972f8c076d57cd95bb8b2/files/en-us/web/api/htmlelement/offsetleft/offsetleft.jpg\">8.4 KB</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/95ac0ebd0953f2846f5446c52207e4e9831dad3b/files/en-us/web/api/htmlelement/offsetleft/offsetleft.jpg\">5.9 KB</a></td>\n<td>30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">web/css/reference/at-rules/@font-face/font-style/garamondunstyled.jpg</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/c82ef871532e8cf9bf8972f8c076d57cd95bb8b2/files/en-us/web/css/reference/at-rules/@font-face/font-style/garamondunstyled.jpg\">8.4 KB</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/95ac0ebd0953f2846f5446c52207e4e9831dad3b/files/en-us/web/css/reference/at-rules/@font-face/font-style/garamondunstyled.jpg\">2.8 KB</a></td>\n<td>66%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">web/api/webxr_device_api/lighting/specularlight-titan.jpg</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/c82ef871532e8cf9bf8972f8c076d57cd95bb8b2/files/en-us/web/api/webxr_device_api/lighting/specularlight-titan.jpg\">5.4 KB</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/95ac0ebd0953f2846f5446c52207e4e9831dad3b/files/en-us/web/api/webxr_device_api/lighting/specularlight-titan.jpg\">2.7 KB</a></td>\n<td>51%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">web/api/window/createimagebitmap/50x50.jpg</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/c82ef871532e8cf9bf8972f8c076d57cd95bb8b2/files/en-us/web/api/window/createimagebitmap/50x50.jpg\">1.4 KB</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/95ac0ebd0953f2846f5446c52207e4e9831dad3b/files/en-us/web/api/window/createimagebitmap/50x50.jpg\">909 B</a></td>\n<td>35%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Paths are relative to <code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/</code>. Both GIFs decode pixel-identical to the originals. The JPEGs are re-encoded at quality 75; please check them visually via the links above. <code class=\"notranslate\">oriole.jpg</code> keeps its EXIF orientation, which the <code class=\"notranslate\">image-orientation</code> example relies on.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Depends on:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5729930536\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45999\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45999/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45999\">#45999</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46004",
            "title": "chore(attachments): compress images flagged by sharp-based filecheck",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-06T22:13:17.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-06T21:39:30.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "caugner",
                "url": "https://github.com/caugner"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update filecheck to compress JPEG, PNG, and GIF images with sharp and optimize SVGs with SVGO directly. Remove imagemin dependencies and temporary compression files.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Simplify image compression dependencies and remove standalone binary installation scripts.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Regression tests cover format preservation, GIF frames and timing, transparency, EXIF orientation, and file size limits.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Behavior changes compared to imagemin:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>JPEG: mozjpeg's <code class=\"notranslate\">cjpeg</code> reused the quality of JPEG input and kept its metadata, so it never flagged a JPEG in this repo. sharp re-encodes at quality 75 with mozjpeg optimizations and applies the EXIF orientation before stripping metadata. A full run over <code class=\"notranslate\">files/</code> newly flags 15 existing files (13 JPEGs, 1 PNG, 1 GIF), which CI only reports once a PR touches them.</li>\n<li>GIF: gifsicle was lossless. sharp re-quantizes frames: 55 of the 58 GIFs in this repo re-encode pixel-identical, the other 3 show small colour shifts or merge a near-duplicate frame while keeping its delay, and none of them exceeds the compression threshold.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45999",
            "title": "build(filecheck): replace imagemin with sharp",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-06T22:12:07.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-06T14:15:05.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "caugner",
                "url": "https://github.com/caugner"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added Experimental Features release for <code class=\"notranslate\">random()</code> CSS function</li>\n<li>Added <code class=\"notranslate\">random()</code> CSS function to Firefox 158 release in Experimental Section</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Working on <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45903\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45903/hovercard\">MDN issue #45903</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45729\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45729/hovercard\">Content PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30756\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30756/hovercard\">BCD PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45997",
