                "url": "https://github.com/dletorey"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add a cross-platform workflow that runs <code class=\"notranslate\">npm ci</code> on macOS, Ubuntu, and Windows.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Identify platform-specific dependency installation failures.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The workflow runs on pull requests that modify <code class=\"notranslate\">.github/workflows/pr-check_npm.yml</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">.npmrc</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">.nvmrc</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">package.json</code>, or <code class=\"notranslate\">package-lock.json</code>. It also supports manual dispatch.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45993",
            "title": "ci(npm): add cross-platform install workflow",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-06T12:57:56.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-06T08:51:25.000Z",
