            "date_published": "2026-10-06T04:25:08.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "SatvikMishra08",
                "url": "https://github.com/SatvikMishra08"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As per <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5717427726\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45985\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45985/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45985\">#45985</a>, there are some broken paths in our audio and video skill test. This was caused by some rearrangements we did recently to get rid of some unneeded files.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR fixes the broken paths, and also updates the video example so that the subtitles actually display. I've added some text to explain why the VTT file needed to be in the same origin as the example.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #45985.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5717427726\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45985\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45985/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45985\">#45985</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
